<!---
A dismissible notice banner.

@summary Inline notice.
@deprecated Use alert-box instead.
@prop {string} [tone=info] - Visual tone: info, success, or warning.
@prop {boolean} [dismissible=false] - Show a close button.
@attr {string} [role=status] - Landmark role on the host.
@slot - Notice content.
@slot action - Optional button area.
@slot ghost - Documented but absent from the template.
@csspart body - The content wrapper.
@cssstate dismissed - Set after the close button is used.
@fires {CustomEvent} dismiss - Emitted when the notice closes.
@demo https://example.com/notice - Live demo.
@author Allons-y Studio
--->
<div :class="tone">
  <slot>No notice</slot>
  <slot name="action"></slot>
</div>
